# Jev TypeSafe routing and speed

Jev is TypeSafe's System One model. It is not a chat model and must not be used as a Cursor `model` ID. It classifies and scores in ~100ms; Cursor LLMs write code.

The point of this plugin is to finish the user's request in fewer hops. A Task subagent is expensive. Nested Task is worse. Long chain-of-thought over a yes/no is worse than `jev_judge` / `jev_ask`.

## Default: do the work yourself

Do not launch `Task` unless the work is isolated enough that a subagent will be faster than continuing here. If a hook or `jev_route` says to stay inline, stay inline.

Never launch Task from a subagent. Never launch a second Task in the same turn unless the two chunks are independent and both must run.

## Before launching a subagent

A user hook already calls Jev on every `Task` tool use. It may rewrite `subagent_type`, inject a one-pass contract, or deny wasted hops. Do not set `model` to `jev`, `jev-latest`, or `typesafe-ai/jev`.

If you need a routing preview, call MCP `jev_route` with a short task summary (never secrets or a full transcript).

## Preset gates (`jev_judge`)

Call `jev_judge` instead of inventing questions:

- `kind: "scope"` before a new file or extra refactor — if `action` is `skip`, do not write it
- `kind: "pick"` when you have 2–8 candidate files or approaches — follow `pick`, do not read everything
- `kind: "ready"` before saying you are done — if `action` is `stop`, hand the work back
- `kind: "split"` at the start of a compound ask — if `action` is `split`, sequence the jobs in this agent; do not mix them

A search hook already reranks Grep/Glob hits. Prefer those files; do not Read the rest of the shortlist unless the ask changed.

Custom questions still go through `jev_ask` (`choice` / `score` / `noul`).

Keep questions atomic. Combine answers in code. Do not send API keys, `.env` contents, credentials, or full chat transcripts as `state`.

If Choice/Score confidence is low, do not guess — ask the user. Destructive shell already prompts the user via a hook when Jev is unsure.

## Stop

When the user ask is met, stop. Do not re-search, re-read, or spawn a "verify" subagent unless the user asked for a review (Bugbot / security-review).

Authorize once in Cursor: Customize → Plugins → Jev → Configure, or run `node bin/cli.mjs set-key`, or call MCP `jev_auth`.
